    comingSoon: false,
    minPlayers: 2,
    maxPlayers: 4,
    routePath: 'block-dominoes',
    LLM: "Game: Block Dominoes. Double-six set (28 tiles). 2-4 players. Match tiles on train ends. Pass if can't play (no drawing). Doubles crosswise, NOT spinners. Two open ends only. Win by dominoing or lowest pips. Score difference. Game to 61 or 100.",
    Player: 'You have 5 tiles: 6-4, 6-3, 6-1, 3-2, 5-5. The open ends are 6 and 2. You control the 6-suit heavily. Do you play 6-4 to maintain your 6 presence on one end, or the 3-2 to keep all three 6-tiles? If the game blocks, your high pips hurt you.',
    tagline: 'Match the ends. Shed your tiles. Block the board.',
